# Local artefacts
#
# Test fixtures are committed (see docs/07-OPEN-QUESTIONS.md B3), but scratch
# output is not. Perf traces in particular are large and machine-specific.
/Tools/output/
*.trace
*.perfdata
coverage/
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Secrets. Nothing here should ever exist, and if it does it must not be
# committed: API keys live in the Keychain, never in the repo.
*.pem
*.p12
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
